      "content": "It sounds like you are in a place of profound despair, and the thought of ending things feels like the only way to find peace. Please know that these intense feelings are treatable, and there are people who want to help you through this darkness. If you are thinking about harming yourself, please call or text 988 in the US and Canada, or contact your local emergency services immediately. There is hope, even when it feels impossible to see it.",
